name=Photon Sword
id=PhotonSword
description=A battery-powered, two-handed energy blade. Find a hilt (rare in sword displays, melee weapon stashes, and junk crates), right-click it to Insert Battery, then Ignite. A lit blade hums, glows in your chosen color, never gets bloody, and drains its battery until it switches itself off.
description=<LINE><LINE>Hotkeys (rebind in Options > Mods > Photon Sword):
description=<LINE>Z: Ignite / Extinguish (draws your sword if your hands are empty)
description=<LINE>R: Swap Battery (R still reloads guns and sharpens blades)
description=<LINE>X: Toggle Cutting while a lit blade is held (off by default; X still racks guns)
description=<LINE><LINE>An ignited sword gets its own stance: a low one-handed rest and walk, and a two-handed ready stance when aiming that now and then beckons. Aiming in the ready stance deflects bullets back at the shooter and soaks part of a shotgun blast, better with Long Blade skill. Running or sprinting puts the blade out until you stop.
description=<LINE><LINE>With cutting on, swings cut doors, windows, walls, objects, and vegetation, as far as the Photon Sword sandbox options allow. Cut Effect chooses Destroy or Set on Fire. Mod options set blade color, light, hum, swing and hit sounds, the beckon, deflect feedback, and can switch the stance back to the game's two-handed animations.
description=<LINE><LINE>Patch mods add deflecting for Project A-Life and Bandits gunfire. Removing the mod from a save deletes any Photon Swords in it. MIT licensed.
author=Dustin Hittenmiller
url=https://codeberg.org/dusteh/PZ_PhotonSaber
modversion=0.2.1
versionMin=42.0.0
